WEBVTT

00:00:10.708 --> 00:00:14.958
Say, Apollon, do you remember...

00:00:14.958 --> 00:00:17.500
...the day the world began?

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:23.000
Billions and billions of stars,
billions and billions of galaxies...

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:26.500
...created in that holy moment from the void...

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:28.167
That miraculous moment...

00:00:28.167 --> 00:00:29.708
Miraculous?

00:00:29.708 --> 00:00:33.833
Yes. And the miracle of how...

00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:39.250
...you and I met on this planet!

00:00:39.250 --> 00:00:41.292
Silffy!

00:00:41.292 --> 00:00:42.458
And now...

00:00:42.458 --> 00:00:44.583
...we move forward on a new path!

00:00:56.583 --> 00:00:58.958
"Skies of Aquaria," huh?

00:00:58.958 --> 00:01:01.083
Oh, pops! Sorry, I'll clean it up right away!

00:01:01.083 --> 00:01:04.917
I show this movie because you're
always bugging me to show it,

00:01:04.917 --> 00:01:08.208
but to be honest, there doesn't seem
to be much of an audience for it.

00:01:10.167 --> 00:01:14.792
Your familiar fragrance... I'll never forget it!

00:01:14.792 --> 00:01:18.125
What's so great about this movie?

00:01:18.125 --> 00:01:22.792
You probably like Alicia,
who played Silffy, huh?

00:01:25.375 --> 00:01:28.792
You shouldn't just let your fate pass you by...

00:01:28.792 --> 00:01:33.292
That's how I feel when I watch her.

00:01:33.292 --> 00:01:37.875
You're quite spirited. I'll take over
the projection after this finishes.

00:01:37.875 --> 00:01:39.833
Go ahead and take a break, Amata.

00:01:39.833 --> 00:01:42.833
Just clean up the area
around the seats in the theater.

00:01:42.833 --> 00:01:44.333
See you later!

00:01:47.208 --> 00:01:51.333
I will continue to wait for you...

00:01:51.333 --> 00:01:56.167
...even if I have to wait ten thousand
years and two thousand more.

00:02:04.750 --> 00:02:06.542
"A Myth That Holds an End"

00:02:06.542 --> 00:02:11.125
Whoa! There's still some left in it. Geez...

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:21.208
Um... Excuse--

00:02:28.875 --> 00:02:30.750
Hm?

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:34.167
I-I'm sorry! I'm leaving now!

00:02:41.958 --> 00:02:43.542
Um...

00:02:46.708 --> 00:02:48.792
E-Er...

00:02:48.792 --> 00:02:52.375
Do you like "Skies of Aquaria"?!

00:02:52.375 --> 00:02:56.292
Well, I saw it for the first time today.

00:02:56.292 --> 00:02:59.583
I-I see...

00:02:59.583 --> 00:03:01.083
Well, then...

00:03:01.083 --> 00:03:05.625
Um... Could you tell me
your name... if you don't mind?

00:03:07.625 --> 00:03:10.375
I'm Mikono Suzushiro.

00:03:10.375 --> 00:03:13.083
Amata... I'm Amata Sora!

00:03:13.083 --> 00:03:15.708
Is that... so...?

00:03:21.250 --> 00:03:23.417
--Um...
--Yes?

00:03:23.417 --> 00:03:27.750
Thank you very much for coming
to see a movie at our theater.

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:33.833
Say...

00:03:33.833 --> 00:03:36.042
Do you sell the pamphlet for the movie?

00:03:36.042 --> 00:03:41.875
Sorry, but it was released over ten years ago,
so we don't have things like that.

00:03:41.875 --> 00:03:46.208
If you don't mind...
would you like to chat with me?

00:03:46.208 --> 00:03:50.167
I'd like to hear about "Skies of Aquaria."

00:03:50.167 --> 00:03:52.917
R-Really?!

00:03:52.917 --> 00:03:56.958
But I still have to finish cleaning this place.

00:03:56.958 --> 00:03:59.958
"I will continue to wait for you...

00:03:59.958 --> 00:04:03.000
...even if I have to wait ten thousand
years and two thousand more."

00:04:04.083 --> 00:04:07.625
Just kidding. Here I am
imitating the movie already.

00:04:12.125 --> 00:04:15.917
Oh, shoot! This isn't good! I'll float...

00:04:19.958 --> 00:04:21.917
C-Could you wait for me outside?

00:04:21.917 --> 00:04:25.167
I'll be right out in five minutes...
no, three minutes!

00:04:35.792 --> 00:04:37.792
Let's see...

00:04:37.792 --> 00:04:41.333
I wonder if three plates
on each foot would do...

00:04:41.333 --> 00:04:44.333
I talked to her without thinking...

00:04:44.333 --> 00:04:47.167
But to think that I could make
friends with such a cute girl...

00:04:58.958 --> 00:05:03.542
No! Don't go! Don't leave me here!

00:05:03.542 --> 00:05:07.250
All I could do was let my
fate pass me by on that day.

00:05:08.750 --> 00:05:11.750
But it's different now.

00:05:13.583 --> 00:05:16.000
Don't get all shy now, Amata.

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:17.917
She said it too, right...?

00:05:19.667 --> 00:05:22.792
"I will continue to wait for you...

00:05:22.792 --> 00:05:26.167
...even if I have to wait ten thousand
years and two thousand more."

00:05:30.667 --> 00:05:32.667
Mister! Two, please!

00:05:45.958 --> 00:05:48.708
In Shinde-chine, which was raided by Abductors,

00:05:48.708 --> 00:05:50.875
transportation is shut down,

00:05:50.875 --> 00:05:53.042
and it's still uncertain
when it will return to normal...

00:05:53.042 --> 00:05:55.250
So Abductors came again.

00:05:55.250 --> 00:05:56.875
Sounds like it.

00:05:56.875 --> 00:06:00.542
This town's gotten quiet
because of Abductors, hasn't it?

00:06:00.542 --> 00:06:03.583
We have fewer customers
at our movie theater, too.

00:06:03.583 --> 00:06:05.875
I wonder where they'll target next.

00:06:05.875 --> 00:06:10.125
No matter how many times the Aquarias
drive them away, there's no end to it.

00:06:10.125 --> 00:06:15.417
Abductors are scary, but it's kind of
a shame to confine ourselves at home.

00:06:15.417 --> 00:06:17.208
We should come outside and feel the sun!

00:06:17.208 --> 00:06:20.083
You're a positive thinker, Mikono.

00:06:20.083 --> 00:06:22.208
People often say that I'm simple-minded.

00:06:24.417 --> 00:06:25.917
Are you okay?

00:06:30.750 --> 00:06:31.750
What's this?!

00:06:31.750 --> 00:06:33.333
I-I'm sorry!

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:40.333
This cat's name is Shushu.
She seems to like it in there.

00:06:40.333 --> 00:06:42.292
This... cat...?

00:06:42.292 --> 00:06:44.333
Yep. A cat.

00:06:44.333 --> 00:06:46.667
Th-That's a unique cat.

00:06:46.667 --> 00:06:50.958
I found her in a burned-down building
after the Abductors ran away.

00:06:50.958 --> 00:06:54.625
Oh, yeah, please tell me about the movie.

00:06:54.625 --> 00:06:55.875
Sure.

00:06:55.875 --> 00:07:00.250
"Skies of Aquaria" is based
on a legend about a battle

00:07:00.250 --> 00:07:03.750
between mankind and Shadow Angels
that supposedly happened a long time ago.

00:07:03.750 --> 00:07:06.625
That's the fairy tale about
12,000 years ago, right?

00:07:06.625 --> 00:07:09.000
The movie itself wasn't really appreciated,

00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:11.375
but the theme song got
an award in a film festival.

00:07:11.375 --> 00:07:13.875
Oh, that song was really good.

00:07:13.875 --> 00:07:18.458
The singer was the actress who
played Silffy... Alicia, was it?

00:07:18.458 --> 00:07:21.667
Her acting was really good,
and she had a nice air about her, too!

00:07:21.667 --> 00:07:24.417
I never knew there was such a pretty actress...

00:07:24.417 --> 00:07:27.333
Yeah... she's pretty, isn't she?

00:07:27.333 --> 00:07:28.833
So pretty that it's almost cruel...

00:07:28.833 --> 00:07:30.792
Huh?

00:07:30.792 --> 00:07:35.042
Ah! Shushu! You ate it all?! Geez...

00:07:41.875 --> 00:07:44.500
Say, Amata... Do you know this...?

00:07:44.500 --> 00:07:47.083
I heard that somewhere in the world,

00:07:47.083 --> 00:07:51.042
there's a school that
trains Elements... Aquaria pilots.

00:07:51.042 --> 00:07:52.708
Only people with special powers,

00:07:52.708 --> 00:07:57.500
who have been chosen by Aquarias,
can enter that school...

00:07:57.500 --> 00:08:01.042
Just like Apollon and Silffy...

00:08:01.042 --> 00:08:05.000
Say, do you feel like you
want to pilot an Aquaria, too?

00:08:08.917 --> 00:08:12.750
There might've been a time
when I felt that way.

00:08:12.750 --> 00:08:16.708
But there's no way that I'd be chosen.

00:08:16.708 --> 00:08:18.667
There's no way that I could do it, either.

00:08:20.208 --> 00:08:21.375
I see.

00:08:21.375 --> 00:08:24.250
Yeah... Me, too.

00:08:24.250 --> 00:08:27.167
There's no way I could do it, either.

00:08:27.167 --> 00:08:30.125
We're the same! We both are incapable!

00:08:34.250 --> 00:08:36.083
I-I'm gonna go to the restroom!

00:08:36.083 --> 00:08:37.750
You go on ahead!

00:08:47.125 --> 00:08:51.292
Come in, Kagura. How dare you
pull such a stunt without permission?

00:08:51.292 --> 00:08:53.958
Mithra Gnis is still in a testing phase.

00:08:53.958 --> 00:08:56.208
Armed reconnaissance on Vega is still--

00:09:00.750 --> 00:09:03.583
Something smells good.

00:09:03.583 --> 00:09:05.417
So this is Vega, huh?

00:09:11.458 --> 00:09:15.125
Eight, nine, ten...

00:09:18.250 --> 00:09:20.417
"We both are incapable," huh?

00:09:20.417 --> 00:09:22.250
Even though it's a negative thing to say,

00:09:22.250 --> 00:09:27.042
I sort of feel relieved when
Mikono says it cheerfully.

00:09:27.042 --> 00:09:28.542
Just how long are you gonna sit there?

00:09:28.542 --> 00:09:31.333
Dad! I can't hold it anymore! I can't!

00:09:31.333 --> 00:09:32.917
Sorry!

00:09:37.292 --> 00:09:39.208
I'll be right out!

00:09:40.958 --> 00:09:42.292
What the heck?!

00:09:42.292 --> 00:09:44.000
Dad!

00:09:54.417 --> 00:09:55.958
Abductors!

00:10:46.333 --> 00:10:48.500
Mikono!

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:50.542
This way! Let's go to the shelter!

00:11:06.042 --> 00:11:07.542
Mikono!

00:11:16.125 --> 00:11:17.667
Aquaria!

00:11:33.542 --> 00:11:38.417
Geez, those kidnappers never learn.
They keep coming one after another!

00:11:38.417 --> 00:11:40.625
Enough with the chit-chat, Andy.

00:11:40.625 --> 00:11:44.417
This is Aquaria M-type.
We're gonna pursue the Abductors.

00:11:44.417 --> 00:11:48.625
Understood. May we receive
guidance from the myth.

00:11:48.625 --> 00:11:52.417
At any rate, they're sending
in quite a few this time.

00:11:52.417 --> 00:11:54.583
I'm worried about the casualties there.

00:11:54.583 --> 00:11:57.292
Headmaster... I mean, Commander.

00:11:57.292 --> 00:12:01.250
Isn't it too much for boys to handle,
since their judgment lacks subtlety?

00:12:01.250 --> 00:12:02.792
Judgment?

00:12:02.792 --> 00:12:05.917
Women are a lot more untrustworthy
in terms of their judgment, aren't they?!

00:12:05.917 --> 00:12:08.958
A large Abductor is
approaching to the battlefield!

00:12:08.958 --> 00:12:10.833
It's an unknown type that
we don't have in our data!

00:12:10.833 --> 00:12:12.333
What?!

00:12:19.292 --> 00:12:22.125
--What the hell?!
--We've never seen this type before!

00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:33.500
I-It's fast!

00:12:33.500 --> 00:12:35.875
Compared to the Abductors we're used to...

00:12:35.875 --> 00:12:38.583
...it's incomparably faster and more powerful!

00:12:43.667 --> 00:12:46.250
We're detecting vital signs
inside the enemy machine!

00:12:46.250 --> 00:12:47.333
What?!

00:12:47.333 --> 00:12:49.083
It has a pilot?!

00:12:49.083 --> 00:12:51.625
A visitor from another dimension...

00:12:51.625 --> 00:12:53.125
You jerk!

00:12:57.375 --> 00:12:59.792
Aquaria is at its wits' end...

00:12:59.792 --> 00:13:03.042
That Abductor looks as if
it's playing with the Aquaria.

00:13:09.125 --> 00:13:10.167
Crap!

00:13:10.167 --> 00:13:11.625
Vector Z's been damaged!

00:13:11.625 --> 00:13:13.417
High-dimensional quantum level has dropped!

00:13:13.417 --> 00:13:16.125
Headmaster... I mean, Commander!

00:13:26.417 --> 00:13:29.000
Yes, sir. Right away.

00:13:31.542 --> 00:13:33.667
We'll send in the F-type as well.

00:13:33.667 --> 00:13:35.125
--What?!
--What did you just say?

00:13:35.125 --> 00:13:38.125
Are we going to use the M-type
and the F-type at the same time?

00:13:38.125 --> 00:13:41.083
Commander! I thought that was taboo!

00:13:41.083 --> 00:13:44.917
We can't afford to do nothing
and lose the M-type!

00:13:44.917 --> 00:13:46.708
Hurry up and send it into combat!

00:13:50.750 --> 00:13:53.208
You son of a bitch!

00:13:53.208 --> 00:13:54.708
The target has been detected!

00:13:54.708 --> 00:13:56.458
Missile, lock on!

00:13:56.458 --> 00:13:57.958
Fire!

00:14:11.375 --> 00:14:13.167
What?! The F-type?!

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:21.625
So we finally meet, boys.

00:14:21.625 --> 00:14:24.625
As I thought, guys are sloppy fighters.

00:14:24.625 --> 00:14:26.458
They're full of openings. I can't bear to watch.

00:14:26.458 --> 00:14:29.417
Oh, Cayenne!

00:14:29.417 --> 00:14:31.125
Whoa! Girls!

00:14:31.125 --> 00:14:33.750
I-Isn't this bad, Instructor?

00:14:33.833 --> 00:14:34.458
"Forbidden"

00:14:34.750 --> 00:14:36.917
This is a risky gamble.

00:14:36.917 --> 00:14:41.292
What if worst comes to worst and
the boys' and girls' Vectors merge?

00:14:41.292 --> 00:14:45.750
No matter how much they desire each other,
they're fated never to be together.

00:14:45.750 --> 00:14:49.917
The purity wall known as
the Guize Stone will hinder it!

00:14:49.917 --> 00:14:51.875
"Forbidden" "Sealed" "Forbidden"

00:14:54.750 --> 00:14:59.042
Interesting... The prey over
on this side smells different.

00:14:59.042 --> 00:15:01.042
Listen! We'll attack him from both sides!

00:15:01.042 --> 00:15:03.458
--Roger!
--Don't tell us what to do!

00:15:08.083 --> 00:15:10.125
What a quick one!

00:15:16.792 --> 00:15:18.292
Yikes!

00:15:20.625 --> 00:15:21.833
Th-That was close!

00:15:21.833 --> 00:15:23.958
Hey, boys! Don't hold us back!

00:15:23.958 --> 00:15:26.625
--What'd you say?!
--They aren't coordinated at all!

00:15:26.625 --> 00:15:31.167
They can't help it... as this is their first time.

00:15:36.542 --> 00:15:38.083
What the heck is this?!

00:15:54.500 --> 00:15:56.500
--Mix! Fire jets!
--Roger!

00:16:00.250 --> 00:16:03.583
M-Mikono... Are you okay?

00:16:07.792 --> 00:16:10.167
Amata! You're bleeding!

00:16:10.167 --> 00:16:12.167
--It's okay.
--But...

00:16:12.167 --> 00:16:16.500
It's okay... My body getting hurt is nothing...

00:16:16.500 --> 00:16:20.667
It's a lot better... than my heart getting hurt!

00:16:25.083 --> 00:16:27.458
M-type, can you hear me?!
Hurry up and back us up!

00:16:27.458 --> 00:16:28.833
Hold on a sec!

00:16:28.833 --> 00:16:31.667
Malloy's machine has taken some
damage and it can't muster the power!

00:16:31.667 --> 00:16:34.000
How slipshod! This is why guys are--

00:16:34.000 --> 00:16:35.500
It's coming!

00:16:39.625 --> 00:16:41.208
It's on four legs?!

00:17:07.667 --> 00:17:09.583
This is...

00:17:09.583 --> 00:17:11.167
What's going on?

00:17:16.042 --> 00:17:17.542
What the heck?

00:17:22.750 --> 00:17:24.583
Mikono!

00:17:24.583 --> 00:17:27.625
Amata! No! Stop pushing yourself!

00:17:30.250 --> 00:17:32.208
Mikono!

00:17:36.750 --> 00:17:39.667
The aura level of both Aquarias
is rapidly decreasing!

00:17:39.667 --> 00:17:43.000
--What?!
--Ahh! The Gattai is about to be canceled!

00:17:44.875 --> 00:17:47.042
Aquarias are...!

00:17:47.042 --> 00:17:49.417
I have no choice but to reveal...?

00:17:49.417 --> 00:17:50.917
What?

00:17:56.125 --> 00:17:57.833
Mix! Sazanka!

00:17:57.833 --> 00:17:59.042
Andy!

00:17:59.042 --> 00:18:01.458
Don't mess around! Who said
you could come back?!

00:18:01.458 --> 00:18:06.375
I-I don't know what happened!
All of the sudden, I was here.

00:18:06.375 --> 00:18:08.792
I can still fight!

00:18:08.792 --> 00:18:10.125
Mix...

00:18:10.125 --> 00:18:14.458
The Aquarias forcibly ejected
their Elements on their own?

00:18:21.083 --> 00:18:22.708
Mikono, sorry.

00:18:22.708 --> 00:18:24.208
What?

00:18:27.667 --> 00:18:30.375
"Sorry"? Amata?

00:18:34.167 --> 00:18:38.708
I want to... protect you, Mikono, so...

00:18:38.708 --> 00:18:41.167
...so... I'm sorry!

00:18:49.000 --> 00:18:52.000
I... I'm gonna fly!

00:18:52.000 --> 00:18:56.250
What? What? What?

00:19:07.083 --> 00:19:08.875
Solar Wing...?

00:19:12.167 --> 00:19:13.667
It'll hit us!

00:19:28.375 --> 00:19:31.833
Vital signs are confirmed in Vector Z!
I'll bring it up on the monitor!

00:19:32.958 --> 00:19:34.375
Infiltrators?!

00:19:34.375 --> 00:19:37.708
They've hijacked a Vector?!
Could they be terrorists?!

00:19:37.708 --> 00:19:39.708
Why a man and a woman...?!

00:19:39.708 --> 00:19:41.542
Perform a forced ejection immediately!

00:19:41.542 --> 00:19:43.042
Yes, ma'am!

00:19:44.333 --> 00:19:49.042
It's not working! Their life energy
is completely in sync with the Vector!

00:19:50.083 --> 00:19:54.542
Could it possibly be the Aquarias
who brought those two in?!

00:19:54.542 --> 00:19:56.125
Can't be!

00:19:56.125 --> 00:19:57.917
This place...

00:19:57.917 --> 00:20:01.417
This is probably inside the cockpit of a Vector.

00:20:01.417 --> 00:20:03.417
Why?

00:20:03.417 --> 00:20:06.667
Yeah... I wonder why...

00:20:06.667 --> 00:20:12.375
I feel like I know... what I
should do right here, right now.

00:20:13.667 --> 00:20:15.375
Amata...

00:20:19.250 --> 00:20:20.417
Don't let it...!

00:20:20.417 --> 00:20:22.250
You don't have tell me that!

00:20:22.250 --> 00:20:29.917
Destroy the false name.
Destroy it and shout the true name!

00:20:29.917 --> 00:20:34.292
When you do, the myth will accept you!

00:20:34.292 --> 00:20:36.042
The true name...

00:20:37.083 --> 00:20:38.750
True name?

00:20:38.750 --> 00:20:43.833
That's right. I'm now going
to shout... the true name!

00:20:46.958 --> 00:20:52.333
Sousei Gattai! Go! Aquarion!

00:20:59.583 --> 00:21:00.750
What the...?!

00:21:00.750 --> 00:21:02.417
Aquarion, he said?!

00:21:02.417 --> 00:21:04.708
What? What's going on?!

00:21:04.708 --> 00:21:08.917
Aquarion... Why does he
know that forbidden name?

00:21:15.125 --> 00:21:17.208
Oh...! No!

00:21:17.208 --> 00:21:19.708
What's with this Gattai?!

00:21:19.708 --> 00:21:21.875
I've never experienced this sensation!

00:21:25.000 --> 00:21:27.667
Commander! What's Aquarion?

00:21:27.667 --> 00:21:29.167
Tell me, Donar!

00:21:29.167 --> 00:21:30.333
Not yet!

00:21:30.333 --> 00:21:32.208
As long as we have the Guize Stone,

00:21:32.208 --> 00:21:34.333
the forbidden Gattai among
the two genders won't...

00:21:37.667 --> 00:21:39.542
It's all falling apart...!

00:21:39.542 --> 00:21:43.583
The common sense and the feelings
I had inside me up until now...

00:21:43.583 --> 00:21:45.917
It's all falling apart and is about to burst out!

00:21:47.333 --> 00:21:48.500
It's bursting out!

00:21:48.500 --> 00:21:52.083
Something I've cherished all this
time is going to burst out and...!

00:21:54.583 --> 00:21:57.458
My mind's going blank!

00:22:11.750 --> 00:22:14.250
What's... this form?

00:22:14.250 --> 00:22:17.583
Aquarion has... evolved!

00:22:17.583 --> 00:22:20.125
Aquarion Evol!

00:22:25.500 --> 00:22:27.625
What's this smell?

00:22:29.667 --> 00:22:32.417
It stinks... terribly!

00:22:33.792 --> 00:22:38.375
The forbidden name
engraved on the new form...

00:22:38.375 --> 00:22:40.375
Aquarion Evol!

00:22:41.917 --> 00:22:44.500
A myth holding an end...

00:22:44.500 --> 00:22:47.333
...is about to begin now.

00:22:52.583 --> 00:22:58.042
<i>It wasn't stolen away by the wind</i>

00:22:58.042 --> 00:23:00.917
<i>With the resolve that we cannot turn back,</i>

00:23:00.917 --> 00:23:08.708
<i>we accept the tragedy</i>

00:23:08.708 --> 00:23:13.417
<i>A cavern lies where my heart once was</i>

00:23:13.417 --> 00:23:16.000
<i>If I was older,</i>

00:23:16.000 --> 00:23:21.667
<i>would I have been able</i>
<i>to save you and the future?</i>

00:23:21.667 --> 00:23:29.000
<i>Having only a single means</i>
<i>to protect the one you love,</i>

00:23:29.000 --> 00:23:35.833
<i>you become lost and drift in the sky</i>

00:23:35.833 --> 00:23:43.542
<i>I'll never be able to meet anyone</i>
<i>who means more to me than you</i>

00:23:43.542 --> 00:23:50.000
<i>A long flare that struggles against the moon</i>

00:23:50.000 --> 00:23:56.542
<i>A story that ends even before it begins</i>

00:23:56.542 --> 00:24:02.500
<i>A melody that seals away</i>
<i>the vulnerable tenderness</i>

00:24:02.500 --> 00:24:05.542
<i>The more I play it, the more I sing it...</i>

00:24:05.542 --> 00:24:11.042
<i>It almost destroys me how much...</i>

00:24:11.042 --> 00:24:17.958
<i>...I long for you</i>

00:24:20.167 --> 00:24:22.333
I'm one of those

00:24:22.333 --> 00:24:25.625
who wait longer than the instructions
say when making cup noodles.

00:24:25.625 --> 00:24:29.667
Soaked noodles are... soft!

00:24:30.333 --> 00:24:31.833
"Next Episode 'Forbidden Gattai'"
Next on <i>Aquarion Evol</i>!

00:24:31.833 --> 00:24:33.542
"Next Episode 'Forbidden Gattai'"
"Forbidden Gattai."
